window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Wrecking his heart wasn't part of the plan.</p> <p>One year to accomplish a dream.</p> <p>One year to leave my mark in the world.</p> <p>One year to live my life pretending that I'm not irrecoverably and completely in love with a man I can never have.</p> <p>I wish he would go away. I wish he would stop looking at me like I'm his everything. I wish . . . I had more than a year.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
